  "description": "The validation run for the datapackage preset completed in 12.34 seconds, but the overall result was not valid. A total of three errors were detected across the two tables, and one warning was issued:\u202fTable \u201cdata.csv\u201d inspector has reached 10 error(s) limit.\n\nThe first table, loaded from the local file\u202fdata.csv, took 5.6 seconds to check. It contains 100 rows with the headers **id**, **name**, and **value**, and was read using the file scheme in CSV format with UTF-8 encoding. This table failed validation (valid\u202f=\u202ffalse) and reported two errors: a duplicate\u2011row error at row\u202f45, column\u202f1 (\u201cDuplicate row found.\u201d) and a blank\u2011header error at row\u202f0, column\u202f2 (\u201cHeader is blank.\u201d).  \n\nThe second table was retrieved from\u202fhttp://example.com/other.csv\u202fvia HTTP, required 6.78 seconds to validate, and holds 50 rows with the headers **code** and **description**. It also uses CSV format and UTF-8 encoding, passed validation (valid\u202f=\u202ftrue), and reported no errors."
